Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.85,0:00:03.94,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,My body is hot. I'm panting for breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.41,0:00:06.65,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,The blood's circulating \Nso rapidly inside my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.21,0:00:10.57,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,my heart feels like it's about to burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.47,0:00:13.28,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,When was it that I last felt this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.12,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,It's the same rush I used to feel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:18.49,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,when facing a few dozen enemies at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:23.06,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,But this time, the situation \Nis completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:26.71,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,My body did move on its own, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:28.42,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.63,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,What in the world could have happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:34.71,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,to cause my body to react in that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:37.68,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:44.82,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:48.98,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's all bagged up neatly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:52.69,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I thought it would be best \Nto minimize the volume of garbage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.69,0:00:55.11,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,so I sliced it all up into small pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.11,0:00:58.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wow. It takes up half \Nthe space it usually does!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.40,0:01:00.24,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ms. Servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:36.67,Signs_EpTitle,CAPTION,0,0,0,,{\fad(273,1)\pos(604.5,285.5)\blur1}Episode {\c&H1227CD&}2{\c&H000000&}: {\c&H1227CD&}You{\c&H000000&} Want to Know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.66,0:02:40.13,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I can't believe someone had the nerve \Nto leave this thing in front of my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:40.13,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\c&H151616&\pos(320,281)}Please Adopt Me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:43.97,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs14\fnArial Black\c&H151616&\frz338\fax-0.2\pos(425.5,252.5)}Please Adopt Me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:43.00,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Just what the heck do they think we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:45.79,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi, there appears to be a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.97,0:02:50.18,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,"I bought this dog at a pet shop \Nthinking it was a Pomeranian,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:53.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,but it turns out it's a breed that \Ngrows much larger. Whoopsies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:54.61,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's too big for my home,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:57.54,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,so I decided to leave it at \Na rich-looking family's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:58.94,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Take good care of it, 'kay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:00.50,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Talk about selfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.50,0:03:02.78,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And it pisses me off that \Nthey're so flippant about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.23,0:03:07.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Jeez... What were they going to do \Nif we couldn't keep pets here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:07.87,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs14\fax-0.5\fnArial Black\c&H151616&\pos(352,258)}Please Adopt Me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.28,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:12.73,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Are you going to adopt it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.73,0:03:15.25,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, yeah. I can't just leave it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.71,0:03:18.73,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's so small, and if it's left outside \Nin the middle of summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:20.81,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,it's possible it could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:23.74,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And I can't think of anyone else \Nwho might be willing to take it, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:25.76,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Even if it's small...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.66,0:03:31.02,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,As long as the desire to live is strong enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:37.47,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,you can cling to life, regardless of \Nwho you are or what happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:40.32,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That's the instinct of an animal: to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:46.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Saving a life solely out of pity \Ncan have disastrous consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:50.37,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That puppy was abandoned because \Nit was meant to be abandoned—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:53.51,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,an existence that is not needed by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:58.58,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Such vulnerable beings are \Ndoomed to die in the wild
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:01.18,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,if they are not forced \Nto become strong on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:04.33,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If you carelessly save that life,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:09.21,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,the consequences of your actions \Nmay one day come back to haunt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:13.85,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi, will you be able \Nto bear that responsibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:19.52,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um... I don't really understand \Nthat sort of thing, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.35,0:04:24.03,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yesterday, when you saved my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.72,0:04:27.32,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It wasn't out of pity, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.93,0:04:32.38,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If we see a life in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:36.67,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,our human instinct causes our bodies to act \Nbefore we can even think. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:40.44,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Human instinct...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:45.88,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Besides, I understand \Nwhat it feels like to be left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:49.89,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,In any case, instead of standing around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:52.75,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,let's finish taking out the trash and talk inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.75,0:04:56.52,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If we stay outside, this heat's \Ngoing to boil us till we're well-done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:03.05,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You're so friendly and cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:04.99,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Do you want to try holding him, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.31,0:05:07.12,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,No, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:09.26,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,quite all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.67,0:05:11.20,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You've really been keeping your distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:12.98,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.98,0:05:14.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,See? Look how fluffy he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:22.88,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Are you... afraid of dogs, Ms. Servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:25.64,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,N-No... Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:28.96,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:34.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I really only am afraid of them a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:36.27,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Man, she's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:40.35,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,H-However, if it's an o-order...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:42.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If it's what you wish, Master Hitoyoshi, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:44.94,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You don't have to force yourself that much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:47.03,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Why are you afraid of dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:53.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,When I was a child, the man \NI once considered my mentor...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:55.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,In the name of training,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:59.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,he left me on a mountainside \Nfilled with ferocious wild dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:02.35,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Right... That'd traumatize anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:05.96,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hm, but that's going to complicate \Nmatters with this guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:07.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Man, what to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:11.51,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {echo in Yuki's head},0,0,0,,Man, what to do... What to do... What to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:16.70,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,M-My apologies... for not being of any use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.70,0:06:19.10,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?! I wasn't blaming you or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:23.49,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Just... I was thinking I might need \Nto ask you to bear with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:26.51,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,since I wouldn't want him \Nto be left alone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:30.11,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Even if I were to search \Nfor someone to adopt him,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:31.99,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,it probably wouldn't go that easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:35.16,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,and I'd hate to see him get \Npassed around like a hot potato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:39.93,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:45.02,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,on second thought, may I try holding him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:51.96,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Servant, I'm really glad \Nyou're trying, but seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:55.64,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If you can't do it, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:59.73,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Th-There's nothing... I can't... do...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:02.57,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,He's been pretty well-behaved, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:04.19,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What part are you afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.74,0:07:06.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What part...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.65,0:07:08.49,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Those beastly claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:10.07,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Those ferocious fangs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.07,0:07:11.82,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Those sharp eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:14.16,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,And such.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:17.86,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Sorry... When I look at him, \Nall I see is a big ol' mochi cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:19.12,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Mochi...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:23.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Are you referring to that \Nchewy confection made from rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.42,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yep, that's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:31.76,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I think most people would feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:44.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,He's just play-biting! \NIt's not for real, so calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:45.77,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't throw him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:50.79,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Y-You did a good job trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:54.66,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being so pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:56.49,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:58.95,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, hey... Are you teething, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:06.18,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You mustn't do something that dangerous—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:07.50,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:10.84,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,All right, let's go out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.71,0:08:13.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:19.56,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs10\bord1\shad1\c&H4A774A&\3c&HB4DED7&\4c&H5FAEC2&\pos(397,174.5)}Animal Hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:18.80,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,An animal hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:19.56,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:23.89,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,He seems fine, but I figured we should \Nget him checked, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:36.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Could you stop by the shop \Nnext door for me, Ms. Servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.65,0:08:37.74,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:40.70,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial Black\3c&HCF6D4B&\frz336.2\fax-0.05\pos(381.5,167.5)\c&HE5EEE0&}Chewing Bone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:40.70,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial Black\3c&HCF6D4B&\fax-0.15\shad1\c&H15364A&\4c&HA2BAC6&\frz16.56\pos(163,141.5)}Fresh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:51.55,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,She's seriously trying her best for you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:53.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Doesn't that make you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:04.43,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Thanks for picking out the stuff \NI asked for, Ms. Servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:09.79,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi, you truly are a kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:10.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:16.47,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Up until now, there was no one \Nlike you in my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:20.95,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Where I was, failure was not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:26.71,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That's probably why \Nevery time you're kind to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:32.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I feel a certain distance from you, \NMaster Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:38.03,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Up until now, all I had to do \Nwas what was asked of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.87,0:09:43.97,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But the things you ask of me are all things \NI'm experiencing for the first time, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:49.23,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,every time, regardless of how \Nhard I try, I mess up and fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:54.02,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I... don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.10,0:10:01.28,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,How can I become someone \Nyou need, Master Hitoyoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:08.10,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,It's not as though I haven't been \Nconsidered unneeded before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:14.00,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,In the world I lived in, we had to fight over \Na dwindling number of places to belong,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:16.08,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,like a game of musical chairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.71,0:10:19.45,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,For pawns like us, \Nit didn't matter to those in power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:22.58,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,what age or gender you were, \Nas long as you had the skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.59,0:10:25.18,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,If I wanted somewhere to belong,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.51,0:10:31.32,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,there was only one thing I needed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:33.83,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,But it's different here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:34.23,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs12\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H000101&\3c&HFAFDFA&\pos(428,129)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:40.90,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,What I'm capable of, everything I did \Nto get here—it all amounts to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:46.42,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If only I could have met you \Nthe way that puppy did...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:53.76,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,If only I'd come to know sooner just how much \Nthis world overflows with warmth...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:59.72,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I might have been able to be \Nwho you really want me to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:03.75,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Am I truly allowed to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:10.39,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Don't you think one such as me is unneeded \Nin this world filled with the light of day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:12.74,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Servant, could it be that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:16.54,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hey, don't pull while I'm talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:24.99,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It just sounds like you want to quit your old \Njob and be a normal girl. Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.38,0:11:28.70,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,No more killing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:31.21,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's what I got from that, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:36.63,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,H-Hey... Oh, man. I'm all tangled up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:40.34,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI {background},0,0,0,,Whoa, hey! Stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:40.34,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Quit being an assassin and... be a normal...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:45.39,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,It had never even crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:49.63,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Being an assassin was my sole identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:56.23,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,That's what I was told all along—that in order for someone like me to be needed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:12:00.28,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I needed to kill, and kill, and kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.49,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,That killing people was the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:05.63,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,But if...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:06.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:09.95,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,The sunset's super pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.98,0:12:26.68,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,If I can find a sense of belonging \Noutside of killing people,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.59,0:12:30.30,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,will I be able to get to know him—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:37.86,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,to get to know this warm, sunny world better?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:45.78,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You know, when you first came to my house, \NI was really scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:47.12,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:50.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not used to having \Nassassins around, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:56.00,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,But being with you made me \Nrealize that I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.41,0:13:00.46,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Servant, you're actually \Na really good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.57,0:13:06.01,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,A good girl. A good girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.51,0:13:15.02,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:19.23,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What do I need to do in order \Nto become a normal girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.23,0:13:20.07,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.87,0:13:23.87,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um... That's a hard question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.31,0:13:25.70,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, but I thought of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:30.31,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You seem like you're always worried \Nabout making mistakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.31,0:13:32.29,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,but you said it yourself, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:35.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That everything you've done since \Ncoming here has been new to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:40.81,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,When you're doing something for the first time,\NI think it's normal to make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.19,0:14:00.29,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,It's true... This method cuts the cabbage \Nmore efficiently and evenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:02.46,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,There's no need to mentally prepare, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:06.74,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Maybe being normal is about being efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:10.55,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Okonomiyaki... \NI wonder what kind of food it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:14.00,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I heard that the sauce is \Nthe main part of the dish, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:18.87,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,It seems it's not something fried, \Nbut you need cabbage. Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.31,0:14:22.30,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I feel the cabbage \Nwould go well with the sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.24,0:14:27.12,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:29.63,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,How could he manage to sneak up behind me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.95,0:14:31.27,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Y-You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.18,0:14:34.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You're no mere dog, are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:41.02,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Are you... hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:46.44,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I was able to understand how he was feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:49.15,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,This must be part of being normal, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:14:58.29,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:00.20,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.00,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:05.21,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, you fed him! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:06.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:08.84,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you. Is it yummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:12.93,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You sure can eat. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.28,0:15:15.76,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Your stomach's all round and squishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:18.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Just like mochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.33,0:15:20.74,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Mochi... Mochi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:23.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, it just dawned on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:24.68,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.68,0:15:27.82,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Your name can be Agemochitaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:28.28,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs13\fnComic Sans MS\c&H43514F&\frz354.5\pos(531.5,282.5)}(Mochi is delicious!!!)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:29.78,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:33.98,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I think it's a wonderful name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:38.63,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh! You like it, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.89,0:15:41.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's easy to understand, and on top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:43.05,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I sense something intimidating from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.85,0:15:44.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:49.71,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You chopped the cabbage for me, huh? \NThanks! That's a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:51.51,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,No, this is nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:55.97,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You're starting to get used to being a maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.49,0:16:00.35,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'll do the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:04.81,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, what's up, Agemochitaro? You want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:08.07,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Sorry, buddy. Wait until after dinner, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:10.78,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.78,0:16:12.91,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Would you like me to watch over him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:14.74,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?! Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:16.28,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You don't have to force yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:17.49,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:21.45,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\shad1\c&H182634&\4c&H80A6B3&\frz90\pos(463,78.5)\3c&H87AAB6&\bord2\blur1\fax-0.1}Fresh
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:21.45,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fscx65\bord2\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3B4552&\3c&HF7F6F7&\frz30.18\fax-0.75\pos(515,53.5)}Made In Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:21.45,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fscx85\bord2\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\c&HEAEEFB&\3c&H237AD7&\fax-0.75\pos(559.5,98)\frz33.02}Low lipids and easy to eat\NDelicious and healthy balance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:21.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I want to be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:24.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You've said it yourself, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:27.25,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,He's just a well-behaved puppy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.65,0:16:33.61,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,and yet, all I see is a ferocious wild dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.37,0:16:40.22,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But everything I know about being normal \Nis what you have told me, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:45.47,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Of course, I can't just shake \Nthis fear. But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:50.15,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I want to believe in your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:54.83,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Servant...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:57.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Then I will, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:16:58.83,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'll believe in you, Ms. Servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:02.29,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {echo},0,0,0,,I'll believe in you! \NI'll believe in you! I'll believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:02.29,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an4\q2\fs30\fnArial Black\c&HBB2126&\move(615,30,-615,30)}I'll believe in you!   I'll believe in you!   I'll believe in you!   I'll believe in you!   I'll believe in you!   I'll believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:05.68,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Certainly! Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:23.29,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,May I try holding him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:24.10,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.59,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is this... mochi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:37.36,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Only figuratively! \NHe's actually a dog, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:40.33,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,He's so small and warm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.27,0:17:46.21,Flashback,HITOYOSHI {flashback},0,0,0,,I was really scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:50.84,Flashback,HITOYOSHI {flashback},0,0,0,,But being with you made me \Nrealize that I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.49,0:17:54.80,Flashback,HITOYOSHI {flashback},0,0,0,,Ms. Servant, you're actually \Na really good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:58.12,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I understand how you felt now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:02.63,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's kind of embarrassing to think \NI used to be scared of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:10.61,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H4B5158&\3c&HF0F5F5&\fax-0.35\frz17.8\pos(286,61)}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.35,0:18:16.02,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,This okonomiyaki is so yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.02,0:18:17.98,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The sauce... The sauce...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:22.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The, uh... The dough goes so well \Nwith the cabbage and sauce, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:24.66,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Her vocabulary seems to have reverted \Nto kindergarten level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:29.46,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Okonomiyaki... really is yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.66,0:18:32.60,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Would you like me to make you \Nanother one, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.55,0:18:36.63,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly trouble you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:39.26,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's not what your body language is saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:40.97,Signs,SCREENCAP {red},0,0,0,,{\fad(1,184)\bord2\fs10\c&H2B2530&\3c&H4E3CE1&\frz6.65\pos(448,145)\clip(m 405 166 l 428 123 489 125 499 153)}Okonomiyaki Flour
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.15,0:18:43.66,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's normal to be a little selfish \Nabout what you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:48.98,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,So it's normal to want more okonomiyaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:52.73,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If you insist, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:57.15,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If you have other selfish requests, \Nkeep 'em coming while I'm at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:58.78,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Selfish requests...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.65,0:19:03.93,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Consider it a special reward \Nfor getting along with Agemochitaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:07.46,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:12.75,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I would like you to give me a name \Nas well, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.04,0:19:15.59,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You want me to give you a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.59,0:19:18.66,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes... Just like you did with Agemochitaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:22.68,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um, I don't know if I'll be able to \Nmatch the mood exactly, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:27.05,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hm... It's tough coming up \Nwith something on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:30.39,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Servant, when is your birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.39,0:19:34.81,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I don't know exactly, \Nbut it was during a very cold winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:41.05,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I faintly remember being told that \NI was born on a record-breaking snowy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.05,0:19:43.82,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Winter! You were born in the winter, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.22,0:19:46.91,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Then how about Yuki, for "snow"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:52.19,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR (VOICE),0,0,0,,A cold-blooded killer... \NYour name is Xue, for "snow."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.56,0:19:56.63,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You know, I love snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:58.84,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's so white and beautiful, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.61,0:20:02.43,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Isn't it kinda exciting to see the snow fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.55,0:20:07.06,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,On top of that, snow is actually warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.57,0:20:09.72,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Snow is warm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:11.48,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I heard about it somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.97,0:20:14.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,When the snow gathers on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.14,0:20:17.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,the dirt and seeds underneath don't freeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:19.32,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,and when springtime comes, they sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:23.67,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I was thinking, maybe that's because the snow \Nprotects them by keeping them warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:32.04,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Why did my body react \Nthe way it did at that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.98,0:20:37.21,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Why did I feel such warmth from this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.85,0:20:42.65,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Why does this person move my heart so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:47.68,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,If I stay here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:51.07,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,If I spend more time with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:56.64,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I have a feeling I might be able \Nto find the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.35,0:21:00.40,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:05.49,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Thank you for giving me such \Na wonderful name, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.32,0:21:11.93,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yuki. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:18.00,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,So she smiles like a normal girl, too.
